{"id":"n87760-2-7","stage":4,"title":"훤하다 · 广阔","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n87760-2-7-1","ko":"아파트 이십 층에 살아 보니 어때요?","zh":"住在公寓的二十层感觉怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아파트","meaning":"公寓","explanation":"아파트：公寓","readings":[{"term":"아파트","audio":"/audio/9dc94a9d71345356674e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29610","senseId":"1","lemma":"아파트","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아파트","audio":"/audio/9dc94a9d71345356674e.mp3"}},{"text":"이십","meaning":"20（汉字数词）","explanation":"이：二；십：十；整体数词：20（汉字数词）","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"},{"term":"십","audio":"/audio/c7470d030eddae163a57.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71125","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"28847","senseId":"1","lemma":"십","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이십","audio":"/audio/b97d27f097a8b4a033bb.mp3"}},{"text":"층에","meaning":"层","explanation":"층：层；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"층","audio":"/audio/5987e716eafb9e902330.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20264","senseId":"4","lemma":"층","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"층에","audio":"/audio/6b89f6e8bbb53ac1b45e.mp3"}},{"text":"살아","meaning":"住，生活","explanation":"살다：住，生活；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"살다","audio":"/audio/12dad67abf287f9a30d4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69579","senseId":"10","lemma":"살다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"살아","audio":"/audio/30d811da4a1eb958a364.mp3"}},{"text":"보니","meaning":"做过、经历过（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：做过、经历过（-아/어 보다）；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"2","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보니","audio":"/audio/50ecd95f90550aea6361.mp3"}},{"text":"어때요?","meaning":"怎么样","expla